### ============================================================
### 会话历史 API 测试
### 覆盖：9 个接口 CRUD + 消息操作 + 搜索
### 启动服务：uvicorn api.main:app --reload
### ============================================================

@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@user = test-session-user


### ============================================================
### 一、创建会话（4.2）
### ============================================================

### 1.1 创建默认标题会话
# @name createSession1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "title": "新对话"
}

###
@session_id_1 = {{createSession1.response.body.session.id}}

### 1.2 创建自定义标题会话
# @name createSession2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "title": "三路匹配专项分析"
}

###
@session_id_2 = {{createSession2.response.body.session.id}}

### 1.3 不传 body 创建会话
# @name createSession3
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 1.4 空会话去重：连续创建第 4 个空会话应返回已有的
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "title": "新对话"
}

### 1.5 未登录创建（应返回 401）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "新对话"
}


### ============================================================
### 二、列出会话（4.1）
### ============================================================

### 2.1 列出全部会话
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions?limit=20
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 2.2 分页：取第一页（limit=1）
# @name listPage1
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions?limit=1
X-User-Id: {{user}}

###
@next_cursor = {{listPage1.response.body.next_cursor}}

### 2.3 分页：用 cursor 取第二页
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions?limit=1&cursor={{next_cursor}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 2.4 其他用户看不到（应返回空列表）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions?limit=20
X-User-Id: other-user

### 2.5 未登录（应返回 401）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions


### ============================================================
### 三、追加消息（4.7）
### ============================================================

### 3.1 向会话 1 追加一对消息
# @name appendMsg1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "messages": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "分析最近的三路匹配异常情况",
            "client_id": "temp-user-001"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "## 三路匹配分析结果\n\n共发现 12 条匹配异常，其中 3 条为高风险...",
            "client_id": "temp-asst-001",
            "status": "success",
            "duration_ms": 8432,
            "trace_id": "trace-abc-123"
        }
    ]
}

###
@message_id_user = {{appendMsg1.response.body.messages[0].id}}
@message_id_asst = {{appendMsg1.response.body.messages[1].id}}

### 3.2 追加后验证标题自动推导
### 预期：title 变为首条 user 消息前 24 字
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 3.3 向会话 2 追加消息（带 metadata）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_2}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "messages": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "分析供应商 SUP-001 的价格差异",
            "metadata": {
                "analyst_role": "procurement",
                "use_memory": true
            }
        }
    ]
}

### 3.4 向不存在的会话追加（应返回 404）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "messages": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "test"
        }
    ]
}

### 3.5 无效 role（应返回 422）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "messages": [
        {
            "role": "system",
            "content": "invalid role"
        }
    ]
}

### 3.6 空 content（应返回 422）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "messages": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": ""
        }
    ]
}

### 3.7 其他用户追加（应返回 404）
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: other-user

{
    "messages": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "hack attempt"
        }
    ]
}


### ============================================================
### 四、获取会话详情（4.3）
### ============================================================

### 4.1 获取会话 1 详情（含消息）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 4.2 限制消息数
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}?message_limit=1
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 4.3 不存在的会话（应返回 404）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 4.4 其他用户访问（应返回 404，不是 403）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}
X-User-Id: other-user


### ============================================================
### 五、更新会话标题（4.4）
### ============================================================

### 5.1 手动更新标题
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "title": "三路匹配异常专项"
}

### 5.2 验证 title_auto=false
### 预期：title_auto 为 false
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 5.3 不存在的会话（应返回 404）
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "title": "x"
}

### 5.4 标题超长（应返回 422，max_length=80）
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "title": "这是一个非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常非常长的标题"
}


### ============================================================
### 六、更新消息（4.8）
### ============================================================

### 6.1 更新 assistant 消息内容（模拟 regenerate）
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages/{{message_id_asst}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "content": "## 三路匹配分析结果（更新）\n\n重新分析后发现 15 条异常...",
    "status": "success",
    "duration_ms": 9120,
    "trace_id": "trace-def-456"
}

### 6.2 只更新 status
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages/{{message_id_asst}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "status": "error"
}

### 6.3 更新 metadata
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages/{{message_id_asst}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "metadata": {
        "regenerated_from": "m-old-001",
        "version": 2
    }
}

### 6.4 不存在的消息（应返回 404）
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "content": "x"
}

### 6.5 其他用户更新（应返回 404）
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}/messages/{{message_id_asst}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: other-user

{
    "content": "hack"
}


### ============================================================
### 七、搜索会话（4.9）
### ============================================================

### 7.1 搜索标题关键词
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/search?q=三路匹配
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 7.2 搜索消息内容关键词
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/search?q=SUP-001
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 7.3 仅搜标题
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/search?q=专项&scope=title
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 7.4 仅搜内容
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/search?q=匹配异常&scope=content
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 7.5 无匹配结果
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/search?q=不存在的关键词xyz
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 7.6 空搜索词（应返回 422）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/search?q=
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 7.7 其他用户搜索（应返回空）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/search?q=三路匹配
X-User-Id: other-user


### ============================================================
### 八、删除会话（4.5）
### ============================================================

### 8.1 删除会话 2
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_2}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 8.2 验证已删除（应返回 404）
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_2}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 8.3 列表中不再出现
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 8.4 删除不存在的会话（应返回 404）
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 8.5 其他用户删除（应返回 404）
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions/{{session_id_1}}
X-User-Id: other-user


### ============================================================
### 九、清空全部会话（4.6）
### ============================================================

### 9.1 缺少 confirm（应返回 400）
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "confirm": "wrong"
}

### 9.2 正确清空
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{user}}

{
    "confirm": "DELETE_ALL"
}

### 9.3 验证已清空
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### 9.4 其他用户不受影响（先创建再验证）
# @name createOtherSession
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: other-user

{
    "title": "其他用户的会话"
}

### 验证其他用户会话仍在
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ptp-agent/sessions
X-User-Id: other-user
